This crate (`symphonia-codec-atrac`) is a pure-Rust ATRAC1 and ATRAC3 decoder. It is licensed under
the Mozilla Public License, v. 2.0, like the rest of Project Symphonia.

ATRAC has no public specification. The bitstream parsing, the spectral and Huffman tables
(`src/tables.rs`, extracted programmatically), the QMF synthesis filter bank, the gain compensation
and the joint stereo matrixing follow FFmpeg's `libavcodec/atrac.c`, `libavcodec/atrac.h`,
`libavcodec/atrac1.c`, `libavcodec/atrac1data.h`, `libavcodec/atrac3.c` and
`libavcodec/atrac3data.h`, which are distributed under the GNU Lesser General Public License,
version 2.1 or later. The `vlc` code assignment follows `libavcodec/vlc.c`
(`ff_vlc_init_from_lengths`).

